    "source": "import PrisonersDilemma.Program\nimport PrisonersDilemma.Bots.CooperateBot\nimport PrisonersDilemma.Bots.DefectBot\nimport PrisonersDilemma.Bots.MirrorBot\n\nopen PD\nnamespace PD.Bots\n\n/-- StatedBot0: a behavioral decision tree in the style of EBot. It exploits opponents\n    that cooperate with DefectBot, cooperates with opponents that cooperate with\n    CooperateBot or that mirror-cooperate with me, and defects otherwise. -/\ndef StatedBot0 : Prog :=\n  .ite (.sim .opp (.bot DefectBot)) Action.C\n    (.const Action.D)\n    (.ite (.sim .opp (.bot CooperateBot)) Action.C\n      (.const Action.C)\n      (.ite (.sim .opp (.bot MirrorBot)) Action.C\n        (.const Action.C)\n        (.const Action.D)))\n\nend PD.Bots\n",
